feat(workflow): workflow template & variables foundational infrastructure (Step 1-3)

Step 1: VariableBundle core type
  - Workflow/Domain/VariableBundle.cs - unified type for 3-layer independent variables
  - Deep merge, Set/Patch semantics, StageVariables record
  - 17 unit tests (VariableBundleSpecs)

Step 2: DB Schema (backward-compatible)
  - 4 new tables: ProjectWorkflowProfiles, ProjectTemplates, IssueWorkflowProfiles, WorkflowProfiles
  - ProjectTemplateRow, ProjectWorkflowProfileRow, IssueWorkflowProfileRow, WorkflowProfileRow
  - EF migration + legacy DB support in MohistDatabaseMigrator
  - Old tables preserved for dual-run compatibility

Step 3: WorkflowProfileManager (read entry point)
  - LoadTemplateAsync: 4-priority fallback (run snapshot > issue custom > issue-ref > project default)
  - LoadVariablesAsync: 3-layer merge (project + issue + workflow-run)
  - ExpandTaskWith: template expression expansion + deep merge logic
  - ResolvedTemplate: carries id + structure + embeddedVariables
  - 13 unit tests (WorkflowProfileManagerSpecs)

Design docs: design/workflow-template-variables.md, design/workflow-task-dispatch.md, .plans/workflow-template-variables-migration.md
